  Chat ..> Member
  Chat ..> Message
  Groups ..> Conversation
  Groups ..> Member
  Groups ..> Message
  Friends ..> Friendship
  Friends ..> Block
  Attachments ..> Attachment
  Settings ..> Setting
  Moderation ..> Report
  Reports ..> Report
